{"time": "2026-10-13T11:38:09", "tool": "write_document", "args": {"doc_id": "run_spice_deck", "sections": [{"body": "The LS_UP level shifter must operate from VDDL = 1.4\u20113.3\u202fV to VDDH = 1.4\u20115.5\u202fV, with static supply current <\u202f1\u202f\u00b5A per VDDH rail and propagation delay <\u202f0.5\u202fns. The POR must generate an active\u2011low reset (POR_N) when VDD exceeds ~1.1\u202fV, with release time <\u202f100\u202f\u00b5s and hysteresis >\u202f20\u202fmV across all PVT corners.", "heading": "Requirement", "status": "requirement"}, {"body": "From simulation data the LS_UP static currents are 0.036\u202fnA (VDDH\u2011in0) and 0.042\u202fnA (VDDH\u2011in1) at VDDL=1.8\u202fV, VDDH=5.5\u202fV; propagation delay tpd_in_rise = 0.228\u202fns. The POR release threshold varies 0.975\u20111.346\u202fV (typical 1.14\u202fV at 3.3\u202fV supply, 27\u202f\u00b0C), release time 17.9\u201194.5\u202f\u00b5s (typical 20.8\u202f\u00b5s at 5.5\u202fV, 27\u202f\u00b0C), hysteresis 0.02\u20110.12\u202fV (typical 0.065\u202fV at 5.5\u202fV), and supply current at VDDmax up to 67.4\u202f\u00b5A (ff corner, 5.5\u202fV, 27\u202f\u00b0C).", "heading": "Derived Parameters", "status": "derived"}, {"body": "LS_UP simulation passed for all supply combinations. Measured values (selected):\n- VDDL=1.8\u202fV, VDDH=5.5\u202fV: static_I_vddh_in0 = 0.036\u202fnA, static_I_vddh_in1 = 0.042\u202fnA, static_I_vddl_in1 = 0.002\u202fnA, tpd_in_rise = 0.228\u202fns.\n- VDDL=3.3\u202fV, VDDH=5.5\u202fV: static_I_vddh_in0 = 0.036\u202fnA, static_I_vddh_in1 = 0.042\u202fnA, static_I_vddl_in1 = 0.003\u202fnA, tpd_in_rise = 0.055\u202fns.\nPOR simulation passed for all supply levels. Selected measurements (tt corner, 27\u202f\u00b0C):\n- VDD=3.3\u202fV: release_threshold_v = 1.139\u202fV, release_time_us = 34.53\u202f\u00b5s, reassert_threshold_v = 1.091\u202fV, hysteresis_v = 0.048\u202fV, supply_current_at_vmax_uA = 14.531\u202f\u00b5A.\n- VDD=5.5\u202fV: release_threshold_v = 1.146\u2